        "TileImage": "$($repository 93aeb20f-58d8-40c6-84e6-7211290f2088).Image",
        "Description": "47, your first target is Huge Grober, he stole the famous sourdough crust pizza dough recipe of our client and is now posing as a Pizza guy to smuggle the recipe to a black market pizza dealer. Our client wants to make an example out of him, so make sure not a piece of him will be left. Your other 2 targets are his accomplices on the inside, make sure to dispose of them too, with your signature accuracy and flare. \r\rGood luck, 47.",
